    "headline": "Xylem (NYSE:XYL) Reports Q2 CY2026 In Line With Expectations",
    "summary": "Water technology company Xylem (NYSE:XYL) met Wall Street’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 1.5% year on year to $2.34 billion. On the other hand, the company’s full-year revenue guidance of $9.2 billion at the midpoint came in 0.6% below analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $1.46 per share was 9.2% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
